<article class="container">
  <h1>About Mexilink</h1>
  <p>Mexilink was founded to remove the friction from cross-border trade between the United States and Mexico. We combine licensed customs brokerage, multimodal freight forwarding, and hands-on trade consulting so companies of every size can move goods across the border predictably and compliantly.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>Our mission</h2>
    <p>We help manufacturers, distributors, and retailers ship with confidence across the US-Mexico border by eliminating compliance risk, reducing transit times, and providing transparent, real-time visibility into every shipment.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Our approach</h2>
    <p>Every client is assigned a dedicated cross-border logistics team that manages documentation, customs clearance, and carrier coordination end-to-end — from the first mile to the last mile, on both sides of the border.</p>
  </section>
